title: Panzerkreuzer A
subtitle: A political question
tags: event, govt_affairs
is-card: true
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_seen = 1
face-image: img/panzerkreuzer.jpg
view-if: panzerkreuzer_seen = 0 and year = 1928 and month >= 8 and month < 10 and reichswehr_minister_party != "SPD" and spd_in_government = 1
new-page: true

= Panzerkreuzer

The Reichswehr Ministry is demanding the construction of a new battlecruiser, as part of Germany's rearmament. The party leadership, and our center-right coalition members are united in support. While some of our members are vehemently against new military spending; this vote may be necessary to preserve the coalition. Even if the prospect frightens their grassroots party members, the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> are likely to vote with us to keep the coalition together. The [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> have also switched their positions for construction, fragmenting their party.?]

- @vote_yes: Vote yes, for constructing the battlecruiser.
- @vote_no: Vote no, against constructing the battlecruiser.
- @abstain: Abstain from the vote.

@vote_yes
on-arrival panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; kpd_coalition_dissent += 1; kpd_relation -= 6; workers_kpd += 4; workers_z -= 2; unemployed_z -= 2; workers_spd -= 4; unemployed_spd -= 2; dvp_left += 1; ddp_right += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1; lvp_left += 1; goal_spd_cancel += 1; hindenburg_angry -= 5

As expected, we voted for the battlecruiser, bringing the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> with us. This sparks outrage in the supportive parties' working class supporters, but pleases our coalition members, along with our center and right wing.

The campaign against the battlecruiser fails, with only the dissident <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> members voting against. The ship will be built.

@vote_no
on-arrival: dvp_relation -= 8; lvp_relation -= 5; spd_relation += 7; pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 2*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1; dvp_right += 1; ddp_left += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1; lvp_right += 1; hindenburg_angry += 5; panzerkreuzer_no = 1;
go-to: vote_no_chancellor if chancellor_party = "SPD"; vote_no_pass if chancellor_party != "SPD"

@vote_no_chancellor
go-to: braun if chancellor = "Braun"; built if (spd_r + kpd_r + sapd_r + z_r < 50) and chancellor = "Müller"; not_built if (spd_r + kpd_r + sapd_r + z_r >= 50) and chancellor = "Müller"

@braun
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_funded = 0; nationalism -= 6*(1-dissent); reichswehr_loyalty -= 0.05; left_strength += 10; center_dissent += 10; reformist_dissent += 10; neorevisionist_dissent += 5; panzerkreuzer_failed = 1; workers_spd += 5; workers_z += 5*(1-dissent); ddp_left += 1; ddp_cohesion += 1; pacifism += 1; kpd_relation += 5; spd_relation += 7; reichswehr_goal_spd += 1; hindenburg_angry += 5; coup_progress += 1

Our party members and coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! However, Chancellor Braun manages to persuade our cabinet ministers to drop the plan to vote on the battlecruiser. The ship will not be built! Pacifism is starting to find support in the [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?].

@vote_no_pass
go-to: built_bruning if (spd_r + kpd_r + sapd_r  z_r < 50); not_built_bruning if (spd_r + kpd_r + sapd_r z_r >= 50)

Our party members and coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! Chancellor [+ chancellor +] brings the matter to a Reichstag vote, which passes with all parties in favor except the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>, <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> and the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]. The ship will be built.

@abstain
on-arrival: dvp_relation -= 5; lvp_relation -= 3; spd_relation += 7; workers_spd -= 4; workerz_z += 3*(1-dissent) center_dissent += 7; reformist_dissent += 7; neorevisionist_dissent += 5; panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; kpd_relation -= 3; ddp_right += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1

Our party members and coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! Our decision to abstain legitimises our party among the working class, as they feel we are the only bourgeois party willing to go against the military. The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> is also motivated the to vote against the battlecruiser thanks to our decision, limiting defections to the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>.

@built
on-arrival:  panzerkreuzer_funded = 1;

Our party members and coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! Our decision to vote against legitimises our party among the working class, as they feel we are the only bourgeois party willing to go against the military. The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> is also motivated the to vote against the battlecruiser thanks to our decision, limiting defections to the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>. Despite Chancellor Müller's rejection of the proposal, the other parties bring the matter to a Reichstag vote, which easily passes, with only the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?], <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> voting against. The ship will be built.

