Our party members and coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! Our decision to vote against legitimises our party among the working class, as they feel we are the only bourgeois party willing to go against the military. The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> is also motivated the to vote against the battlecruiser thanks to our decision, limiting defections to the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>. Despite Chancellor Müller's rejection of the proposal, the other parties bring the matter to a Reichstag vote, which fails! the ship will not be built!

