Our party members and coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! Our decision to vote against legitimises our party among the working class, as they feel we are the only bourgeois party willing to go against the military. The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> is also motivated the to vote against the battlecruiser thanks to our decision, limiting defections to the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>. Chancellor [+ chancellor +] brings the matter to a Reichstag vote, but with our support, the vote against the battlecruiser succeeds. The ship will not be built!
